---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Terms of Service - US Emergency Local Hub">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-primary mb-8">Terms of Service</h1>
    <div class="prose prose-gray max-w-none leading-relaxed space-y-4 text-gray-700">
      <p><strong>Effective Date:</strong> July 29, 2026</p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-primary mt-8">1. Nature of Service</h2>
      <p>US Emergency Local Hub operates LocalRestoreHub.com as an <strong>informational directory service</strong>. We connect users with third-party contractors, service providers, and emergency dispatch services. We are not a restoration company, and we do not employ contractors or perform any restoration services ourselves.</p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-primary mt-8">2. No Warranty or Guarantee</h2>
      <p>We make no warranties, express or implied, regarding the quality, timeliness, or availability of services provided by third-party contractors listed on or accessed through our directory. All service providers are independent contractors and are not employees or agents of US Emergency Local Hub.</p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-primary mt-8">3. Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p>To the fullest extent permitted by law, US Emergency Local Hub shall not be liable for any damages arising from or related to:</p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1">
        <li>Services performed by third-party contractors.</li>
        <li>Any errors, omissions, or inaccuracies in directory listings.</li>
        <li>Any interruption or cessation of directory services.</li>
        <li>Any content submitted by third parties.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-primary mt-8">4. Third-Party Services</h2>
      <p>Our directory may contain links to third-party websites and phone numbers. We have no control over and assume no responsibility for the content, privacy policies, or practices of any third-party services.</p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-primary mt-8">5. User Responsibility</h2>
      <p>Users are responsible for verifying the credentials, licensing, and insurance of any service provider they engage. We recommend obtaining written estimates and contracts before authorizing any work.</p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-primary mt-8">6. Changes to Terms</h2>
      <p>We reserve the right to update these terms at any time. Continued use of the site after changes constitutes acceptance of the new terms.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
